From 0220d55ebf099583905f801d486ac424894d02af Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 15:37:08 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Native FireRed/LeafGreen and Ruby/Sapphire ROMs for the
 emulated GBA ports

The launcher keeps optional ROMs for the other Gen 3 games. Importing a save from one of them
switches that port to the game's own ROM and uses the save as it is, so the trainer, bust and party
come from the game and no model is pinned. Without the ROM the old Emerald rebuild remains. A hosted
room still runs Emerald on both GBAs, so native ports are rebuilt as Emerald first. Restoring the
default save returns the port to Emerald.
